{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>בשמעו</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the others: וירא בצר להם בשמעיו את רנתם, and בשמעו את דברי האלה הזאת — because it was narrow for them that they had no bread to eat, and rightfully they complained — שמע תלונותם — but one who is at peace, and in his hearing the words of the curse and blessing his heart, saying: שלום יהיה לי — HaShem does not hearken to him."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:13:10.470808550Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}